# Swamp of Sorrows - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The pack's Alliance route for the contested Swamp (zone key 1435,
# order 36). Every Swamp accept in the local census (19 quests,
# docs/swamp-of-sorrows-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept
# and once as a turnin. Band 30-38 by minLevel cluster (ten at min30,
# top min36). 17 Horde accepts set aside for the Horde block, 16
# above-band records out (Fallen Hero, Eranikus, amulet, Warrior
# 8423-8425, Visions chains). No class, race or profession gates: the
# data locks none of the 19. The four Craftsman's Writs ride optional
# + when-skill gated with bag notes (sourceless item-starts, crafted
# turn-ins). Cortello's Riddle starts from a Stranglethorn object and
# ends in Dustwallow (Barrens copy noted); the entomology specimens
# are caught in Stranglethorn, Arathi and Desolace; deliveries run to
# the Blasted Lands, Riverglades and Desolace - the contract is
# accept-based, so the zone's chains are followed wherever they lead.
guide butler-routes-completionist/swamp-of-sorrows
title Swamp of Sorrows - Completionist
levels 30-38
zone Swamp of Sorrows
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Nethergarde - the caravan chain

  zone map 1435

  note Enter from the Blasted Lands border; Watcher Biggs holds the Nethergarde caravan chain.
  accept 1396 -- Encroaching Wildlife - Watcher Biggs; crocolisks, spinners and jaguars, west wilds
  complete 1396 @27.1,55.13 -- Young Sawtooth Crocolisk (west wilds)
  complete 1396 @30.32,54.77 -- Young Sawtooth Crocolisk (west wilds)
  complete 1396 @25.38,59.33 -- Sorrow Spinner (west wilds)
  complete 1396 @28.34,62.04 -- Sorrow Spinner (west wilds)
  complete 1396 @26.33,60.73 -- Swamp Jaguar (west wilds)
  complete 1396 @31.66,29.4 -- Swamp Jaguar (west wilds)
  turnin 1396 -- Encroaching Wildlife - the cull to Watcher Biggs
  accept 1421 -- The Lost Caravan - Watcher Biggs; the wizards' reagents in the Fallow Sanctuary, east (Fallow leg below)

step Fallow Sanctuary - the caravan chest

  zone map 1435

  complete 1421 @64.46,18.3 -- Wizards' Reagents (Caravan Chest, Fallow Sanctuary)
  accept 1393 -- Galen's Escape - Galen Goodward; escort out of the Fallow Sanctuary (@65.47,18.16, same ground)
  complete 1393 @53.08,29.55 -- Escort Galen out of the Fallow Sanctuary
  turnin 1393 -- Galen's Escape - Galen's Strongbox (@47.81,39.76, his camp west)
  goto 54.9,34.1 -- Noboru the Cudgel (south of the Fallow Sanctuary)
  collect 6196 "Noboru's Cudgel" optional
  note Noboru's Cudgel drops off Noboru the Cudgel here - accept 1392 below when it drops.
  accept 1392 -- Noboru the Cudgel - the cudgel to the Harborage leader (Harborage leg below)

step Harborage - draenethyst and the mage's word

  zone map 1435

  accept 1389 -- Draenethyst Crystals - Magtoor; six crystals to the Harborage (@25.98,31.4, northwest)
  complete 1389 @55.09,30.08 -- Draenethyst Crystal (Harborage approach)
  complete 1389 @62.08,22.45 -- Draenethyst Crystal (east ground)
  complete 1389 @64.76,22.7 -- Draenethyst Crystal (east ground)
  turnin 1389 -- Draenethyst Crystals - the crystals to Magtoor
  accept 93464 -- The Visiting Mage - Magtoor; the Desolace mage who knows draenethyst (Desolace expedition below)
  turnin 1392 -- Noboru the Cudgel - the cudgel to Magtoor
  turnin 1421 -- The Lost Caravan - the reagents to Watcher Biggs (Nethergarde return below)

step Nethergarde return - driftwood and the shipments

  zone map 1435

  accept 1398 -- Driftwood - Watcher Biggs; sundried driftwood, the east coast run below
  complete 1398 @83.51,13.78 -- Sundried Driftwood (east coast)
  complete 1398 @89.79,22.36 -- Sundried Driftwood (east coast)
  complete 1398 @94.65,49.99 -- Sundried Driftwood (east coast)
  complete 1398 @86.35,81.45 -- Sundried Driftwood (far east shore)
  turnin 1398 -- Driftwood - the driftwood to Watcher Biggs
  accept 1425 -- Deliver the Shipment - Watcher Biggs; the shipment to Quartermaster Lungertz in Nethergarde Keep, Blasted Lands (Blasted expedition below)
  accept 94929 -- Deliver the Second Shipment - Watcher Biggs; the shipment to Demar Brant at Farholde Keep in the Riverglades (Riverglades expedition below)

step West wilds - the entomologist and the light

  zone map 1435

  accept 93176 -- My Little Friends - Amaryllis Webb; three specimens caught abroad, one each in Stranglethorn, Arathi and Desolace (specimen legs below - the kit is the sourcing note)
  goto 22.32,50.41 -- Father Tuttle (west wilds)
  note Cortello's Riddle (item 4056) is picked up off Cortello's Riddle object in Stranglethorn - accept 624 below when it drops; no placed source in this zone.
  accept 624 -- Cortello's Riddle - solve the riddle; the Soggy Scroll waits in the west wilds (@22.87,48.19, below)
  turnin 624 @22.87,48.19 -- Cortello's Riddle - the riddle to the Soggy Scroll
  accept 625 -- Cortello's Riddle - the Soggy Scroll's word; the Musty Scroll waits in Dustwallow (Dustwallow expedition below)
  accept 93585 -- This Light of Mine - Father Tuttle; escort to the Harborage (no objectives in the data - walk him to Magtoor, turnin below)

step Harborage return - Tuttle's light

  zone map 1435

  turnin 93585 -- This Light of Mine - Father Tuttle to the Harborage, word to Magtoor

step North - blood, bait and the Fallow fishermen

  zone map 1435

  note Blood of My Blood: the data lists no objectives although the log text says slay 10 Lost Ones in the Fallow Sanctuary - no complete can be written from data, so accept and turnin only.
  accept 93429 -- Blood of My Blood - Karana; Lost Ones, Fallow Sanctuary (see note above)
  turnin 93429 -- Blood of My Blood - Karana's word
  accept 93430 -- Taking the Bait Back - Pelluk; the Lucky Lure off the Lost One Fisherman, Fallow water (@43-59,27-32, below)
  complete 93430 @48.66,30.44 -- Lucky Lure (Lost One Fisherman, Fallow water)
  complete 93430 @56.58,30.73 -- Lucky Lure (Lost One Fisherman, Fallow water)
  turnin 93430 -- Taking the Bait Back - the lure to Pelluk

step East - Shadow Oil writ (optional craft)

  zone map 1435

  when skill Alchemy 1

  goto 62.39,52.85 -- Mukomonji (east Swamp)
  note Craftsman's Writ: Shadow Oil (item 264064) turns up in loot - the data names no placed source, so accept 94264 below when the writ drops; craft or buy the Shadow Oil beforehand.
  accept 94264 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Shadow Oil - Mukomonji; Shadow Oil, Alchemy work (see note above)
  turnin 94264 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Shadow Oil - the Shadow Oil to Mukomonji

step East - Big Voodoo Mask writ (optional craft)

  zone map 1435

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  goto 62.39,52.85 -- Mukomonji (east Swamp)
  note Craftsman's Writ: Big Voodoo Mask (item 264100) turns up in loot - the data names no placed source, so accept 94300 below when the writ drops; craft or buy the Big Voodoo Mask beforehand.
  accept 94300 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Big Voodoo Mask - Mukomonji; Big Voodoo Mask, Leatherworking work (see note above)
  turnin 94300 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Big Voodoo Mask - the Big Voodoo Mask to Mukomonji

step East - Mithril Frag Bomb writ (optional craft)

  zone map 1435

  when skill Engineering 1

  goto 69.98,41.6 -- Bullets Bigblast (far east)
  note Craftsman's Writ: Mithril Frag Bomb (item 264088) turns up in loot - the data names no placed source, so accept 94288 below when the writ drops; craft or buy the Mithril Frag Bombs beforehand.
  accept 94288 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Mithril Frag Bomb - Bullets Bigblast; Mithril Frag Bombs, Engineering work (see note above)
  turnin 94288 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Mithril Frag Bomb - the Mithril Frag Bombs to Bullets Bigblast

step East - Orange Martial Shirt writ (optional craft)

  zone map 1435

  when skill Tailoring 1

  goto 69.98,41.6 -- Bullets Bigblast (far east)
  note Craftsman's Writ: Orange Martial Shirt (item 264112) turns up in loot - the data names no placed source, so accept 94312 below when the writ drops; craft or buy the Orange Martial Shirt beforehand.
  accept 94312 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Orange Martial Shirt - Bullets Bigblast; Orange Martial Shirt, Tailoring work (see note above)
  turnin 94312 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Orange Martial Shirt - the Orange Martial Shirt to Bullets Bigblast

step Blasted expedition - the first shipment

  zone map 1419

  turnin 1425 -- Deliver the Shipment - the shipment to Quartermaster Lungertz

step Riverglades expedition - the second shipment

  zone map 2548

  turnin 94929 -- Deliver the Second Shipment - the shipment to Demar Brant

step Desolace expedition - the mage and the picker

  zone map 1443

  turnin 93464 -- The Visiting Mage - Magtoor's word to Azore Aldamort
  goto 49.16,58.45 -- Flesh Picker ground (Desolace)
  collect 213567 "Flesh Picker Specimen" optional
  note Flesh Picker specimen for My Little Friends (93176) - caught here, turned in back in the Swamp (Amaryllis Webb). Two of three specimens; the third rides the Arathi leg.

step Arathi expedition - the weevil

  zone map 1417

  goto 31.12,29.53 -- Hay Weevil ground (Arathi)
  collect 213568 "Hay Weevil Specimen" optional
  note Hay Weevil specimen for My Little Friends (93176) - caught here. One of three specimens; the other two ride the Desolace and Stranglethorn legs.

step Stranglethorn expedition - the tarantula

  zone map 1434

  goto 44.05,22.65 -- Arbor Tarantula ground (Stranglethorn)
  collect 213566 "Arbor Tarantula Specimen" optional
  note Arbor Tarantula specimen for My Little Friends (93176) - caught here. Last of the three specimens; turnin back in the Swamp.

step Dustwallow expedition - the Musty Scroll

  zone map 1445

  turnin 625 @31.11,66.14 -- Cortello's Riddle - the riddle's end at the Musty Scroll (Dustwallow copy)
  note The data also shows this scroll in the far-south Barrens (51.6,88.2) - either copy advances the riddle; this guide routes Dustwallow.

step Swamp return - the specimens home

  zone map 1435

  turnin 93176 -- My Little Friends - the three specimens to Amaryllis Webb
